01:47:05.433 --> 01:47:07.033
&gt;&gt; PRABHAKER RAGHAVAN:
Awesome job, Jon and Scott.

01:47:07.033 --> 01:47:07.733
Thank you for that.

01:47:11.366 --> 01:47:16.699
The final announcement we are
going to make today thinks of G

01:47:16.699 --> 01:47:19.633
Suite kind of in the same
way you think of your teams.

01:47:19.633 --> 01:47:23.033
They work really well together
but they also need to work

01:47:23.033 --> 01:47:24.199
